    </p>

    <p class="mt-10 max-w-xl text-base leading-relaxed">
        MakersCon PH is an annual national gathering that brings together innovators, hobbyists, makers, and FABLAB leaders and educators to share discoveries, collaborate, and discuss innovations. This year’s event, MakersCon PH 2026, is hosted by the UP CFA FabLab as it celebrates 10 years of making, learning, and community-building.
    </p>
